comment:
I wish Tesla does a better job when using FSD during the night on highways. It sucks when you get the message that one or more cameras are not available or blinded and you are forced to disable FSD to pass a car that is driving too slow on your lane, and then, no more FSD. And you don't have access to TACC (Traffic-Aware Cruise Control) at least, so you are caught in driving the car without a cruise control. 
@AIDRIVR if you can, please ask Tesla to at least allow TACC available when FSD is not available. With the winter coming, it is not uncommon to drive on the highway in pitch black dark at 6 p.m. 
I have a Tesla, I have HW4, I like FSD but Tesla should take care of this TACC problem when FSD is not available. We have TACC with Auto Pilot. Why can't we have TACC with FSD ?!?

Congratulations !

An electric predator – as quiet as a cat, but its claws are sharp;

A minimalist alien – an interior so stark you feel like you're in a spaceship;

A pragmatic hurricane – because despite its wildness, it can still fit IKEA groceries and a stroller;

Adrenaline in a suit – because it looks polite, but all you have to do is touch the gas pedal to realize there's no room for boredom here.
